1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,360
We are working up an appetite after smelling all the spices in the old town joy tells me about a famous area in chongqing that is known for its different street food stalls.
闻着香料，两人胃口渐开。Joy 告诉我，重庆有一片地方以各式街边小吃摊出名。

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,920
So we are heading there to see what I can get within my budget.
所以，我们正过去看看，在预算内能吃到什么。

3
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:14,949
We're going to take a hundred yuan which is about 13 and see how many different foods we can try.
我们拿一百元，当时约合十三美元，看看能尝多少不同食物。

4
00:00:14,959 --> 00:00:20,114
Are you hungry yeah I'm so hungry let's go let's go.
你饿了吗？是啊，我很饿。走吧，走吧。

5
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:32,150
So the first traditional food I will introduce you is the pork intestine it's spicy with tofu but it's so delicious.
我要先介绍的传统食物是猪肠，辣辣的，配豆腐，不过很美味。

6
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:35,519
I thought we were getting intestine soup but he actually gave us brain soup.
我以为点的是肠汤，结果他给的是脑花汤。

7
00:00:35,519 --> 00:00:40,399
I think if you eat this you get smarter really really spicy broth.
对方开玩笑说，吃这个会更聪明。汤真的非常辣。

8
00:00:40,399 --> 00:00:49,509
My brain wants to tell me it's bad but it's actually pretty good I'll give this an 8 5 out of 10.
我的脑子觉得这东西应该不好吃，但实际挺好，我给八点五分，满分十分。

9
00:00:49,519 --> 00:00:56,560
They say that chongqing is the spice capital of china and this is why look I can taste it from here.
大家说重庆是中国的辣味之都，这就是原因；看，我站在这里都像能尝到了。

10
00:00:56,560 --> 00:01:00,880
Crazy wa she's drinking food.
太夸张了，哇，她像是在喝着吃东西。

11
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:06,470
What is that on the inside is actually the beverage on the top is the chicken meat.
那是什么？里面其实是饮料，上面是鸡肉。

12
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:11,119
That's genius there's so many options I don't know what to get.
真有创意。选择太多了，我都不知道买什么。

13
00:01:11,119 --> 00:01:15,829
That's a big ass piece of bacon it's 26 for one.
好大一块肉；这里用了较粗口语强调。对方说，一份二十六元。

14
00:01:15,839 --> 00:01:22,679
Cheers cheers oh my god 10 out of 10 nine nine.
干杯！天哪，十分，十分；对方给九分。

15
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:32,399
This is really a street food heaven so many different flavors things you've never heard of before textures and colors and tastes.
这里真是街头小吃天堂：各种风味、没听过的东西，还有不同质地、颜色和味道。

16
00:01:32,399 --> 00:01:35,920
Literally on the other side of this market is a rainbow colored building.
市场另一侧，就有一栋彩虹色的建筑。

17
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:39,280
Which if this building was in any city in Europe it'd stand out like a sore thumb.
如果放在欧洲某个城市，它可能会显得非常突兀。

18
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:42,000
But here in chongqing nobody even blinks an eye at it.
但在重庆，似乎没人为它惊讶。

19
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:48,070
So many options wait durian with cheese I think we're going to have to try this one.
选择这么多。等等，榴莲配芝士？这个我们得试试。

20
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:51,920
Thank you wo it looks like lasagna but it's durian.
谢谢。哇，看起来像千层面，但里面是榴莲。

21
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:59,079
I can tell you're excited for this one creamy.
看得出你很期待这一份。口感很绵滑。

22
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:08,199
I think it's really good I'm giving this 8 3 out of 10 what about you 10 she got a full 10 delicious.
我觉得很好吃，给八点三分。你呢？十分，满分！好吃。

23
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:12,479
We still have a lot of money left it's not going down much.
我们还剩不少钱，预算好像都没怎么减少。

24
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:19,510
What's next this is like the dried tofu there's only 13 quai.
接下来是什么？像是豆干，只要十三块；quai 为人民币口语单位的自动识别。

25
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,599
What I love about chongqing is that.
我喜欢重庆的一点是——我喜欢重庆的一点是，

26
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:28,560
What I love about chongqing is that there's all these inventions like you can find square pieces of tofu with all kinds of stuff inside.
这里有这些新花样，比如方块豆腐，里面放了各种东西。

27
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:34,390
Spicy spicy they have the green onion pickles peas yeah many things inside.
辣辣的，里面有葱、腌菜、豌豆，很多种配料。

28
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:38,880
I give this a 7 5 out of 10 what about you five onward.
我给七点五分。你呢？五分。继续吧。

29
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:43,110
We got a little bit of money left and we have room for one more dish which is a dessert.
我们还剩一点钱，也还吃得下一道，来份甜点吧。

30
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:49,750
It's sweet cute dessert look at this sweet and cute it's definitely chinese.
甜甜的、可爱的甜品。看，又甜又可爱，样子很有中国元素。

31
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:53,760
Let's get the cutest one what about the panda the panda.
挑最可爱的吧。熊猫怎么样？就熊猫。

32
00:02:53,760 --> 00:03:00,310
It only needed 21 when else do you get the chance to try cute panda ice cream.
只要二十一元。什么时候还能有机会尝这么可爱的熊猫冰淇淋呢？

33
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:03,280
The hardest part about eating this is we're going to have to ruin the perfection.
吃它最难的地方，就是得破坏它完美的造型。

34
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:07,270
Got to get a little bit of the chocolate I'm going to go for the eyeball first.
先吃一点巧克力，我打算从眼睛下手。

35
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:09,990
I really I really messed it up that was.
哎，我真的把它弄坏了；这里保留说话时的停顿和没说完的短语。

36
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,200
After all that spicy and savory food this is the best way to end it.
吃了那么多辣的、咸香的东西，这就是最好的收尾。

37
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:20,159
All that for 13 yes so cheap so cheap 1 to 10 wo really cool I give it a 12 as well.
这些总共只花当时约十三美元？是啊，真便宜。满分十分的话，我也给十二分！
